      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Global standards, curated maintainer-rejection exhibits, targeted standard examples (selectors harvested from the lint payload's standard and rule ids), the review-lint findings block (flagged when the QA scanner could not run), the slice diff truncated under a character limit with an explicit reduced-evidence banner, and the output contract."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
